c0,c1,c2,c3 re-derived (matches script 01):
 c0 = gamma*k*(2*gamma**2*k**2 - 6*gamma*k**2 + 3*gamma*k + 6*k**2 - 6*k + 1)/(12*n**2)
 c1 = (gamma**2*k**2/2 - gamma*k**2 - gamma*k*n + gamma*k/2 + k**2/2 + k*n - k/2 - n/2 + 1/12)/n**2
 c2 = (2*gamma*k - 2*k - 2*n + 1)/(4*n**2)
 c3 = 1/(6*n**2)

==============================================================================
PART A -- the TRUE ideal leading constant lambda(gamma) (Estagio 36,
re-derived independently here as a cross-check)
==============================================================================
lambda(gamma) = 4*(2*gamma - 3)/(gamma*(gamma - 2))
lambda(1)   = 4  (expect 4)
lambda(1/2) = 32/3  (expect 32/3 ~ 10.667)

==============================================================================
PART B -- the CURRENT crude bound's hat_lambda(gamma) (continuation/
sharper_tail fronts), re-derived independently as a cross-check
==============================================================================
hat_lambda(gamma) = 8*(4*gamma - 7)/(gamma*(gamma - 2))
hat_lambda(1) = 24  (expect 24)
hat_lambda/lambda at gamma=1: 6  (expect 6)
hat_lambda/lambda as gamma->0: 14/3  (expect 14/3 ~ 4.667)

==============================================================================
PART C -- THIS FRONT's lambda_tight(gamma): exact max of the signed
cubic over the TRUE asymmetric support, TRUE (uninflated) K
==============================================================================
x_K(D_max) [D=(1-gamma)K] = K*(2*K**2 + 6*K*gamma**2*n - 12*K*gamma*n + 6*K*n - 3*K + 6*gamma*n - 6*n + 1)/(12*n**2)
x_K(D_min) [D=-gamma*K]   = K*gamma*(K*gamma - 2*K + 1)/(2*n)

lim_{n->infty} x_K(D_max)/ln(n) = 4*(-gamma**2 + 2*gamma - 1)/(gamma*(gamma - 2))
lim_{n->infty} x_K(D_min)/ln(n) = -4

lambda_tight(gamma) candidate := max(|lim_plus|, |lim_minus|) =
  Max(4, 4*Abs((gamma**2 - 2*gamma + 1)/(gamma - 2))/gamma)

